WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.820
Grandpa, Ellen, Philip, Robbie, you and me.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.560
That's six steaks.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Don't forget Susan.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.360
Seven steaks.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.260
Cooking dinner for the entire family is not so easy.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.880
The shopping: the salad:

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.960
tomatoes, lettuce, cucumbers, and onions.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.480
The main course: steak and potatoes.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.880
Richard, how much broccoli do I need for seven people?

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.900
Marilyn, I have to tell you something.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.640
At today's exercise class...

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.400
Yes, Richard.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:54.520
Well, I didn't really exercise.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.940
I knew it!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.720
I wanted to, but Jack Davis needed a photographer.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.720
I'm sorry, Marilyn.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:05.020
I don't understand. Did you exercise or not?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.640
No. Instead of exercising, I photographed the class.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.960
And you didn't exercise?

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:11.180
No.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:19.320
There's another advanced class today at four o'clock.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.840
We'll go together.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:28.600
Oh, the bet is still on, but you shop for the groceries.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.060
Remember, you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:40.560
You win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.040
Including Susan.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.400
Four o'clock at the advanced exercise class. With me.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.620
This is fun. It's a piece of cake.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:56.480
Yeah. Just wait.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:02.620
5, 6, 7, go right, 1, 2, back,

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:07.760
2, 3 , 1, 2, 3, pony, pony...

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.760
I can barely move.

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:46.660
All right. That's it for today.

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.340
Thank you, everyone. See you next week.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.090
Thank you, Jack, but no thank you.

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:57.160
The advanced exercise class is not so easy, huh?

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:03.460
No, no, you were right. I was wrong.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.470
Come on, Richard. Get up. Let's go.

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:12.380
You have to cook dinner for the entire family.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:16.440
Marilyn, I'm exhausted. I can't move.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.400
Excuse me, Richard, Marilyn.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.600
You are a terrific instructor, Jack.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.800
Thanks. But I have a question.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.800
Is this your very first advanced aerobics class?

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.320
Yes, it is.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.780
You are in great shape, Richard.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.000
Very few people last in this class

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.540
for the full hour the very first time.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.980
It's true. You are in great shape.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.400
Thanks!
